    {
      "turn_id": 1,
      "text": "Good morning . How are you ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 3,
      "text": "Oh ? What are you worried about ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 5,
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that . Why do you think so ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 7,
      "text": "How do you sleep ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 9,
      "text": "Do you find it difficult to get to sleep , or do you wake up early ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 11,
      "text": "Are you worried about anything ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 13,
      "text": "I see . please take off your shirt and lie down on the couch ."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 15,
      "text": "Well , there's nothing very much wrong with you , I'm glad to say.You ' re working too hard and worrying too much.Do you take much exercise ?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 17,
      "text": "I can , but I'm not going to . You don't need medicine . You need advice . Don't work so hard . Too much work is bad for you . Don't worry about your work.It ' s silly to worry . Take regular exercise ."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 19,
      "text": "Then get an easier one , even if you earn less money . Which would you rather have , health or wealth ?"
    }
  ],
